Dear {{subscriber_name}},

Your subscription to {{publication_name}} has been successfully activated.

Subscription details:
- Plan: {{plan_name}}
- Start date: {{start_date}}
- Renewal date: {{renewal_date}}
- Subscription ID: {{subscription_id}}

Access your subscription: {{subscription_url}}

Thank you for supporting {{publication_name}}.

Regards,
Subscription Services Team

Dear {{subscriber_name}},

Here are today’s important stories selected by our editorial team.

Today’s highlights:
1. {{headline_one}} — {{summary_one}}
2. {{headline_two}} — {{summary_two}}
3. {{headline_three}} — {{summary_three}}
4. {{headline_four}} — {{summary_four}}

Read the full stories: {{news_url}}

Stay informed with {{publication_name}}.

Best regards,
Editorial Team

Dear {{subscriber_name}},

We are reporting an important development concerning {{topic}}.

What happened: {{verified_summary}}
Where: {{location}}
When: {{date_time}}
Latest information: {{latest_information}}

Read the latest updates: {{article_url}}

We will update this story as more confirmed information becomes available.

Regards,
Newsroom Team
{{publication_name}}

Dear {{subscriber_name}},

Here is your weekly selection of recently published and widely read stories.

This week’s highlights:
- {{article_one}}
- {{article_two}}
- {{article_three}}
- {{article_four}}

Explore the full collection: {{digest_url}}

Thank you for reading {{publication_name}}.

Best regards,
Editorial Team

Dear {{subscriber_name}},

We have just published a new article that may interest you.

Title: {{article_title}}
Author: {{author_name}}
Published: {{publication_date}}

{{article_introduction}}

Read the full article: {{article_url}}

We hope you find it informative.

Regards,
Editorial Team
{{publication_name}}

Dear {{subscriber_name}},

This is a reminder that your subscription is scheduled to renew on {{renewal_date}}.

Subscription details:
- Plan: {{plan_name}}
- Renewal amount: {{amount}}
- Renewal date: {{renewal_date}}

Manage your subscription: {{account_url}}

Please review your subscription settings before the renewal date if you would like to make changes.

Regards,
Subscription Team

Dear {{subscriber_name}},

We were unable to process the payment for your {{publication_name}} subscription.

Amount: {{amount}}
Payment date: {{payment_date}}
Status: {{payment_status}}

Please review your payment details and retry the payment through your account.

Update payment: {{payment_url}}

For assistance, contact {{support_email}}.

Regards,
Billing Team

Dear {{subscriber_name}},

We are pleased to invite you to {{event_name}}, organised by {{organisation_name}}.

Event details:
- Date: {{event_date}}
- Time: {{event_time}} {{time_zone}}
- Venue or platform: {{venue_or_online_link}}
- Speakers: {{speaker_details}}

Register here: {{registration_url}}

We look forward to welcoming you.

Best regards,
Events Team
{{organisation_name}}

Dear {{subscriber_name}},

This email confirms that your {{publication_name}} subscription cancellation has been processed.

Subscription: {{plan_name}}
Cancellation date: {{cancellation_date}}
Access end date: {{access_end_date}}

You can review your account details here: {{account_url}}

Thank you for being part of our readership. We hope to welcome you back in the future.

Regards,
Subscription Services Team
